| Version | Description | Key Files |
|---------|-------------|-----------|
| v5.1.1 | Add/Remove Liquidity UI + gas 6x boost + position decode fix + fee tracking + swap unstub | `src/lp_liquidity_manager.py`, `src/gui_main_v5.py`, `src/venue_adapters/hyperliquid_writer.py`, `build_gui_v5.py` |
| v5.1 | Hyperliquid Vaults + saved vault snapshots + LP fee fix + wallet selector | `src/gui_main_v5.py`, `src/vault_tracker.py`, `src/venue_adapters/hyperliquid_adapter.py`, `build_gui_v5.py` |
| v5.0 | LP Engine + Hyperliquid Writer + LP Positions tab + CTkTabview | `src/gui_main_v5.py`, `src/venue_adapters/hyperliquid_writer.py`, `build_gui_v5.py` |
| v4.2 | Customizable RPC endpoints + Standard/Advanced mode + API key management | `src/rpc_config.py`, `rpc_endpoints.json`, `src/balance_engine.py` (updated), `src/gui_main_v4.py` (updated) |
| v4.1 | Go Online toggle + balance fetching + price feeds + ERC-20 + compact cards | `src/gui_main_v4.py`, `src/balance_engine.py`, `src/price_engine.py` |

### Versioning Rules
1. New versions introduce a `_v<N>` suffix on new/modified GUI files (e.g., `gui_main_v4.py`, `gui_main_v5.py`).
2. Previous-version files are preserved untouched as the baseline.
3. Core shared files (`crypto_engine.py`, `backup_engine.py`, `main.py`) are extended backward-compatibly.
4. EXE output in `USB_DEPLOYMENT/` is overwritten with the latest version build. Previous EXE is backed up to `backups/` before overwrite.
5. Documentation (`.clinerules`, `README.md`) is updated with each version release.

